  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e04-scene-15",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "别把行政当炮灰  (Never Treat Admin Staff as Pawns)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Pressing her advantage in the courtyard, Bu Xiaogu convinces the two rattled producers that the human-resources director knows every move inside Xingtian. Listen to Xiaogu's Mandarin lines first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谁说我在公司没有后台？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们可能不知道我老板是谁吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我的老板是人力资源总监雷总。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们连公司有人事总监都不知道吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你以为雷总平时不管事，她就心里一点数都没有吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我们小行政虽然没有你们制作人厉害。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "可是以后请不要把我们当炮灰。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "现在麻烦你们帮我把这袋硬盘送回素材房。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这件事跟谁都不要说。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不然我也没办法帮你们保密了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谁说我在公司没有后台？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who says I have no backing inside the company?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们可能不知道我老板是谁吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You probably do not realise who my boss is.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我的老板是人力资源总监雷总。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My boss is Human Resources Director Lei.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们连公司有人事总监都不知道吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did you not even remember our company has an HR director?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你以为雷总平时不管事，她就心里一点数都没有吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you think just because Director Lei stays quiet, she does not know every detail?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我们小行政虽然没有你们制作人厉害。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Junior admin staff like us may not be big producers like you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "可是以后请不要把我们当炮灰。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even so, please never treat us as expendable pawns again.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "现在麻烦你们帮我把这袋硬盘送回素材房。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Now please carry this bag of hard drives back to the archive room for me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这件事跟谁都不要说。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do not breathe a word of this to anyone.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不然我也没办法帮你们保密了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Otherwise there is no way I can keep your secret either.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谁说我在公司没有后台？",
